wh40k-service-open-shop = Show me your stock.
wh40k-service-ask = About your work.
wh40k-service-barter = Can we negotiate?
wh40k-service-stale = That offer has expired. Refresh or request a new appraisal.
wh40k-service-busy = One thing at a time. Finish your current conversation or transaction.
wh40k-service-permission = The permit first. I cannot release this stock without it.
wh40k-service-failed = The transaction could not complete. No unpaid item has been taken.
wh40k-service-bought = Paid and yours. Take good care of it.
wh40k-service-sold = Agreed. Your cash payment is ready or safely queued for delivery.
wh40k-service-pending = The ledger needs checking. Your item stays protected until the result is confirmed.
wh40k-service-appraise = Appraise a held item
wh40k-service-sell = Accept cash offer
wh40k-service-quote = { $product }: { $price } credits in cash (valid for 30 seconds)
wh40k-service-appraisal-refused = I buy only approved loose curios. No quest property, equipped gear, loaded containers or reserved goods.
wh40k-service-transit-title = Reka Dhal — route information
wh40k-service-transit-info = Current sector graph. Select a system to inspect it. Travel is arranged at a real shuttle console.
wh40k-service-fizzo-marker = Fizzo service anchor
wh40k-service-fizzo-flavour-choice = Bar gossip.
wh40k-service-fizzo-flavour = A dockhand says Casey counts every chair before opening. I think he just likes seeing everyone safely home. Bar talk, friend, no job hidden in it.
wh40k-service-rekadhal-title = Port desk
wh40k-service-odranpell-title = Pell’s curios
wh40k-service-odranpell-intro = Careful with that edge. Old things deserve gentle hands, even when their owners do not.
wh40k-service-odranpell-menu = What do you need?
wh40k-service-odranpell-info = Rare papers, retired seals and things with long histories. Hold an approved find for appraisal. I pay cash; other people's property and active job evidence stay off my counter.
wh40k-service-odranpell-farewell = Bring a story next time. The price will still depend on the object.
wh40k-service-odranpell-barter = I will discuss the history until closing. Accounting has already discussed the price and is unfortunately less talkative.
wh40k-service-kappaspanner-title = Spanner’s equipment
wh40k-service-kappaspanner-intro = Expedition preparation detected. Good. Improvisation is expensive and usually screams.
wh40k-service-kappaspanner-menu = What do you need?
wh40k-service-kappaspanner-info = Drill, mining protection, travelling backpack, signal flares and inflatable wall and door packs. Close the breach before admiring the gear. This counter does not perform repairs for you.
wh40k-service-kappaspanner-farewell = Return intact. Equipment inspection is less enjoyable without its operator.
wh40k-service-kappaspanner-barter = The price includes surviving the return journey. I would not advise cutting that particular cost.
wh40k-service-vennors-title = Casey’s host
wh40k-service-vennors-intro = Welcome. You can sit down without proving you can afford the tables.
wh40k-service-vennors-menu = What do you need?
wh40k-service-vennors-info = I welcome guests at the counter and watch the floor. Fizzo owns the place now, Lumen pours, and Borr keeps the air from leaving with your luck. Branna's hot kitchen is at nearby Bahama Mamas; check your route, as it's a separate station.
wh40k-service-vennors-farewell = Leave with enough for tomorrow. I like guests who can come back.
wh40k-service-brannakest-title = Kest's Kitchen - Bahama Mamas
wh40k-service-brannakest-intro = Sit if you can. If you cannot, at least take something better than an empty stomach.
wh40k-service-brannakest-menu = What do you need?
wh40k-service-brannakest-info = Burgers, potatoes, tomato soup, pizza and doughnuts. I cook like they do on Footfall, except people here sometimes have time to sit. Brig handles drinks. I make sure you don't call two glasses a proper lunch.
wh40k-service-brannakest-farewell = Eat while you still remember to. Come back hungry, not hurt.
wh40k-service-brannakest-barter = I like your nerve, but the posted price keeps this counter open. We can talk without changing the ledger.
wh40k-service-marasevrin-title = Sevrin’s clothing
wh40k-service-marasevrin-intro = You need a coat that fits your shoulders, not somebody else’s opinion of you.
wh40k-service-marasevrin-menu = What do you need?
wh40k-service-marasevrin-info = Civilian sets, coats, hats, travelling cloaks, pilgrim clothing and belt bags. Clothes for the road and the city. Rank, clearance and good fortune are not sewn into a coat.
wh40k-service-marasevrin-farewell = Walk with your head up. The hat helps, but the rest is yours.
wh40k-service-marasevrin-barter = I can suggest a simpler piece. Convincing the same amount of cloth to cost less is harder.
wh40k-service-dorianbale-title = Bale’s armoury
wh40k-service-dorianbale-intro = Hands where I can see them. Good. Now we can have a civil conversation.
wh40k-service-dorianbale-menu = What do you need?
wh40k-service-dorianbale-info = Helmets, flak vest, shield and gloves are public stock. Knife, laspistol and lasgun require Imperial clearance. I check the entitlement, not the confidence in your voice.
wh40k-service-dorianbale-farewell = Keep it secured. I would rather sell you supplies than identify what is left of you.
wh40k-service-dorianbale-barter = Protection costs less than a proper funeral. That is my whole advertising campaign and my answer about discounts.
wh40k-service-fizzo-title = Fizzo’s counter
wh40k-service-fizzo-intro = A drink and a quiet minute? I can manage both.
wh40k-service-hestvarn-title = Varn's warehouse supplies
wh40k-service-hestvarn-intro = Appraise, label, pack and carry. Everything for honest bookkeeping, even when the cargo insists it wandered in by accident.
